    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-is14">
        <head xml:id="gom-is14-Hd1e98">Caput 14</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-is14-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-is14-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is14-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is14_1@15-15">Jacob.</quote>
            Nota proprietatem verborum. Jacob qui adhuc in lucta est, miseretur: Israel, qui post victoriam nomen accepit, elegit.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is14-Dd1e111">
          <head xml:id="gom-is14-Hd1e113">Versus 4</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is14-d1e115">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e117" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is14_4@9-9">Quomodo,</quote>
            etc. <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e120"><seg type="qs">Admirando quomodo vastator terrarum</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">novissima autem inimica destruetur mors.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is14-d1e128">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e130" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is14_4@11-11">Exactor.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is14-Rd1e133"><name xml:id="gom-is14-Nd1e134" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e137">Qui exigit usque ad novissimum <pb ed="#P" n="1253B"/> quadrantem a debitoribus suis, qui dicunt illud: <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e141" source="http://scta.info/resource/mt6_12@2-4">Dimitte nobis debita<!-- check: Migne cites mt5; text matches mt6_12 --></quote>. Huic tradentur debitores, huic tradidit Paulus Corinthum fornicantem.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is14-Dd1e148">
          <head xml:id="gom-is14-Hd1e150">Versus 5</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is14-d1e152">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e154" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is14_5@3-3">Baculum.</quote>
            Vocat Nabuchodonosor vel diabolum, quia sicut per illum flagellantur a Deo impii, sic per hunc in poenis inferni vel quotidie in peccato suggerendo, insidiando.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is14-Dd1e159">
          <head xml:id="gom-is14-Hd1e161">Versus 8</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is14-d1e163">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e165" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is14_8@1-2">Abietes quoque.</quote>
            Principes diversarum gentium ab illo afflicti; vel filii, quorum patres interfecit.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is14-d1e169">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e171" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is14_8@10-12">Ex quo dormisti.</quote>
            Quia victo forti et direptis vasis, ejus satellites corruerunt, unde: <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e174" source="http://scta.info/resource/mt25_41@13-22">Ite in ignem aeternum, qui paratus est diabolo, et angelis ejus (Matth. <pb ed="#P" n="1253C"/> XXV)</quote>. Nota mortis mors dormitio dicitur.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is14-d1e180">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e182" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is14_8@15-16">Qui succidat.</quote>
            Unde psalmus: <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e185" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps79_11@1-9">Operuit montes umbra ejus, et arbusta ejus cedros Dei</quote> Has aliquando peccantes tradit Dominus supplicio conterendas: unde dicitur: <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e188" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps28_5@7-9">Conteret Dominus cedros Libani</quote>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is14-Dd1e194">
          <head xml:id="gom-is14-Hd1e196">Versus 9</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is14-d1e198">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e200" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is14_9@1-1">Infernus.</quote>
            Habitatores vel principes ejus inferni subter te. Sub terra enim est infernus, in quo visus est dives ille a Lazaro, unde Dominus vinctos suos eruit, vinctum diabolum dimisit.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is14-d1e204">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e206" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is14_9@12-13">Omnes principes.</quote>
            Etsi haec facta non sunt, tamen fieri potuerunt. Solatium est malorum inimicos habere socios poenarum.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is14-Dd1e211">
          <head xml:id="gom-is14-Hd1e213">Versus 10</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is14-d1e215">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e217" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is14_10@8-9">Vulneratus es.</quote>
            Qui immortalis et Deus videbaris. Nos pro imbecillitate sensuum putabamus <pb ed="#P" n="1253D"/> non posse resistere potentiae Dei, et te solum in altitudine tua permanere.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is14-Dd1e224">
          <head xml:id="gom-is14-Hd1e226">Versus 11</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is14-d1e228">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e230" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is14_11@10-10">Subter.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is14-Rd1e233"><name xml:id="gom-is14-Nd1e234" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e237"><seg type="qs">Putredo tinea et operimentum vermium</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">qui dicebat Christo: <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e243" source="http://scta.info/resource/mt4_9@4-11">Haec omnia tibi dabo, si cadens adoraveris me</quote>.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is14-Dd1e249">
          <head xml:id="gom-is14-Hd1e251">Versus 12</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is14-d1e253">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e255" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is14_12@6-8">Qui mane oriebaris.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is14-Rd1e258"><name xml:id="gom-is14-Nd1e259" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e262"><seg type="qs">Hi sunt falsi apostoli</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">et in lateribus aquilonis, in frigidis.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is14-Dd1e271">
          <head xml:id="gom-is14-Hd1e273">Versus 13</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is14-d1e275">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e277" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is14_13@6-8">In coelum conscendam.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is14-Rd1e280"><name xml:id="gom-is14-Nd1e281" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e284">In firmamento erat, in coelum ubi est Domini solium cupiebat ascendere. Haec omnia ad haereticos sunt referenda, qui cum deorsum sint cum principe suo, jactant se excelsos esse.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is14-d1e287">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1254A"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e291" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is14_13@19-21">In lateribus aquilonis.</quote>
            Unde: Ab aquilone exardescunt mala, et succenditur olla Jeremiae. De quo: <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e294" source="http://scta.info/resource/is43_6@1-3">Dicam aquiloni, Da:</quote> id est, redde captivos.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is14-Dd1e299">
          <head xml:id="gom-is14-Hd1e301">Versus 14</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is14-d1e303">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e305" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is14_14@4-4">Nubium.</quote>
            Id est prophetarum, de quibus: <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e308" source="http://scta.info/resource/is5_6@16-22">Mandabo nubibus meis ne pluant super eam imbrem<!-- check: Migne cites ps35; text matches is5_6 --></quote>. <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e312" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps35_6@6-11">Et veritas tua usque ad nubes.</quote> Judas nubes fuit cum aliis apostolis, sed vitio suo diabolum ascensorem suscepit.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is14-Dd1e318">
          <head xml:id="gom-is14-Hd1e320">Versus 15</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is14-d1e322">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e324" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is14_15@1-4">Verumtamen ad infernum detraheris.</quote>
            Qui per virtutes potuisti ascendere, per vitia cades. Sancti habent pennas columbae et aquilae ut volent et requiescant: impii quasi plumbum merguntur <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e327" source="http://scta.info/resource/zac5">in aquis vehementibus, et descendunt in profundum quas lapis<!-- check: cited chapter given; verse not identified --></quote>. Iniquitas sedet super talentum plumbi.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is14-d1e332">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1254B"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e336" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is14_15@4-4">Detraheris.</quote>
            Invitus Christus; descendit voluntarius.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is14-d1e340">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e342" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is14_15@6-6">Profundum.</quote>
            Ad infimas et pessimas poenas. Quanto enim gradus altior, tanto casus gravior.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is14-d1e346">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e348" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is14_15@7-7">Laci.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e351"><seg type="qs">Id est, inferni</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">sed per teporem et simulationem fidei a Domino rejiciuntur.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is14-Dd1e360">
          <head xml:id="gom-is14-Hd1e362">Versus 16</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is14-d1e364">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e366" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is14_16@11-12">Est vir.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is14-Rd1e369"><name xml:id="gom-is14-Nd1e370" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e373">Non Deus; unde: <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e375" source="http://scta.info/resource/mt13_25@6-10">Inimicus homo superseminavit zizaniam</quote>.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is14-Dd1e381">
          <head xml:id="gom-is14-Hd1e383">Versus 17</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is14-d1e385">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e387" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is14_17@6-6">Urbes.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is14-Rd1e390"><name xml:id="gom-is14-Nd1e391" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e394">Ecclesias, ut faceret synagogas diaboli, et haeretica pravitate pollueret munditiam fidei.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is14-d1e397">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e399" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is14_17@9-11">Vinctis ejus non.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e402"><seg type="qs">Quos solvunt apostoli, imitatores magistri</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">sed in tenebris recludebat, ut nec Evilmerodach filio suo aperiret.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is14-Dd1e411">
          <head xml:id="gom-is14-Hd1e413">Versus 18</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is14-d1e415">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e417" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is14_18@1-2">Omnes reges.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is14-Rd1e420"><name xml:id="gom-is14-Nd1e421" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e424"><seg type="qs">Reges gentium, <pb ed="#P" n="1254C"/></seg> etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">nec in morte quiescit a cruciatibus.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is14-Dd1e434">
          <head xml:id="gom-is14-Hd1e436">Versus 19</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is14-d1e438">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e440" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is14_19@1-2">Tu autem.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e443"><seg type="qs">Videtur fabulae consentire</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">reviviscet pater tuus.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is14-d1e451">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e453" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is14_19@23-24">Quasi cadaver.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is14-Rd1e456"><name xml:id="gom-is14-Nd1e457" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e460">Multitudine peccatorum <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e462" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps37_6@1-6">putruerunt, et corruptae sunt cicatrices meae</quote>. Virtus suavis odoris est.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is14-Dd1e468">
          <head xml:id="gom-is14-Hd1e470">Versus 20</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is14-d1e472">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e474" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is14_20@3-3">Consortium.</quote>
            Scilicet sepulturae. Altera est enim poena auctoris, altera ejus qui ab auctoritate compulsus: Hic est gladius quo vulnerati sunt plurimi, et interfecti.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is14-d1e478">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e480" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is14_20@9-11">Tu enim terram.</quote>
            Quasi: In superbia tua regnum Chaldaeorum destructum est, quod adhuc mansisset, nisi superbia tua non fuisset.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is14-d1e484">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1254D"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e488" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is14_20@14-14">Populum.</quote>
            Quem tibi Deus commiserat corrigendum et regendum.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is14-d1e492">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e494" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is14_20@15-15">Occidisti.</quote>
            Non Deo reservans vivos, sed poenae tuae praeparans socios.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is14-d1e499">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e501" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is14_20@16-17">Non vocabitur.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e504"><seg type="qs">Ideo non vocabitur, in aeternum</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">deleta est omnis progenies, pro superbia et impietate patris.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is14-Dd1e514">
          <head xml:id="gom-is14-Hd1e516">Versus 21</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is14-d1e518">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e520" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is14_21@6-6">Iniquitate:</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is14-Rd1e523"><name xml:id="gom-is14-Nd1e524" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e527">LXX. Pro iniquitate patris tui. Quod quidam non intelligentes, draconem, qui regnat in mari, quem Leviathan appellant, Hebraei volunt esse patrem diaboli; secundum illud: <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e529" source="http://scta.info/resource/io8_44@34-39">Quia mendax est et pater ejus</quote>, quod male intelligendo depravant.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is14-Dd1e535">
          <head xml:id="gom-is14-Hd1e537">Versus 23</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is14-d1e539">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e541" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is14_23@1-2">Et ponam.</quote>
            Nihil est in ea nisi venatio <pb ed="#P" n="1255A"/> regia, et coctilibus muris post annos plurimos refectis inclusa.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is14-d1e547">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e549" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is14_23@4-6">In possessionem ericii.</quote>
            Mundus quoque ab ericio et paludibus possidetur modo, id est, ab immundis spiritibus; sed in fine mundi scopabit, id est, purgabit eum Dominus igne purgatorio.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is14-Dd1e554">
          <head xml:id="gom-is14-Hd1e556">Versus 24</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is14-d1e558">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e560" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is14_24@1-2">Juravit Dominus.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e563"><seg type="qs">Hucusque de Babylone et regibus</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">et hoc in terra Juda et in montibus ejus, sicut Dominus praedixerat.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is14-Dd1e572">
          <head xml:id="gom-is14-Hd1e574">Versus 25</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is14-d1e576">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e578" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is14_25@10-11">In montibus.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e581"><seg type="qs">Nota proprietatem</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">sed et eos qui virtutibus profecerunt.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is14-Dd1e590">
          <head xml:id="gom-is14-Hd1e592">Versus 26</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is14-d1e594">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e596" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is14_26@1-2">Hoc consilium,</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e599"><seg type="qs">id est, auferatur jugum ejus</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">generaliter ad orbem terrarum pertinere.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is14-Dd1e608">
          <head xml:id="gom-is14-Hd1e610">Versus 28</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is14-d1e612">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1255B"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e616" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is14_28@1-4">In anno quo mortuus.</quote>
            A principio libri hucusque sub Ozia, Joatham, Achaz, vaticinatus est Isaias, usque ad finem sub Ezechia praedicta et partim completa.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is14-d1e620">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e622" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is14_28@7-7">Achaz.</quote>
            Quo vivente, regnante in peccatoribus: nec pondus contra alienigenas, nec sermo Dei (juxta Septuaginta) fieri poterat ad Prophetam.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is14-Dd1e628">
          <head xml:id="gom-is14-Hd1e630">Versus 29</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is14-d1e632">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e634" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is14_29@1-2">Ne laeteris.</quote>
            Rege mortuo, inimici laetantur, quasi aliquid lucri facturi novis rebus: hinc Philisthaei, quos Achaz afflixit, de morte ejus laetantur et Judaeis insultant, quia maturo rege perdito, subjaceant ejus filio, quo regnante, se putant fines eorum posse invadere.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is14-d1e638">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e640" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is14_29@9-10">Virga percussoris.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is14-Rd1e643"><name xml:id="gom-is14-Nd1e644" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e647"><seg type="qs">Abjecto jugo Dei</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">et de eis serpentes volantes, vel qui absorbeant <pb ed="#P" n="1255C"/> volucres.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is14-Dd1e658">
          <head xml:id="gom-is14-Hd1e660">Versus 31</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is14-d1e662">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e664" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is14_31@1-1">Ulula.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is14-Rd1e667"><name xml:id="gom-is14-Nd1e668" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e671">Quasi: Philisthaei, plorate miseriam vestram, quae venit per Sennacherib.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is14-d1e674">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e676" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is14_31@1-4">Ulula, porta; clama, civitas.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e679"><seg type="qs">Philisthaei potione cadentes</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">anima malis cogitationibus repleta.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is14-d1e687">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e689" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is14_31@9-12">Ab aquilone enim fumus.</quote>
            Exardescentibus sagittis diaboli, qui noxius oculis et contrarius lumini. Ab aquilone olla Jeremiae succenditur.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is14-d1e693">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e695" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is14_31@15-20">Non est qui effugiat agmen ejus.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e698"><seg type="qs">Nullus praeter Jerusalem</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">et sola Jerusalem sit liberanda.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is14-Dd1e707">
          <head xml:id="gom-is14-Hd1e709">Versus 32</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is14-d1e711">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e713" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is14_32@4-5">Nuntiis gentis.</quote>
            Angelis qui praesunt civitatibus et gentibus: singulis mirantibus, cur sola Sion amaritudinem fumi vitaverit, vel evaserit.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is14-d1e717">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1255D"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is14-Qd1e721" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is14_32@8-9">Fundavit Sion.</quote>
            Super fundamentum prudentiae, justitiae, fortitudinis, temperantiae, quae sunt Christus.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
  </text>
